Comment (frontend/vite.config.ts:12):
`API_BASE_URL` defaults to an empty string (so requests go to `/api/...`). With the current `vite.config.ts` there is no dev-server proxy for `/api`, so `npm run dev` will send API calls to the Vite origin and fail unless users manually set `VITE_API_BASE_URL`. Consider adding a `server.proxy` entry for `/api` (e.g., to `http://localhost:8080`) and/or reading the proxy target from an env var so local dev works out of the box.

